{"4553360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "King Of Leberkas - Austria Restaurant Simulator", "steam_appid": 4553360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>King Of Leberkas – Austria Restaurant Simulator</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own <strong>restaurant in Vienna</strong> and start with a true Austrian classic: the <strong>Leberkäse sandwich</strong>. Your restaurant itself won’t grow in size – but the number of customers definitely will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful though: your guests are not patient. They have the classic Viennese attitude – short temper, lots of complaints, and quick insults if you mess up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hectic to master:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👀 <strong>Take orders:</strong> Look at a customer to take their order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍳 <strong>Cook:</strong> Go to the correct machine and press <strong>E</strong> to prepare food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 <strong>Serve:</strong> Pick it up with <strong>E</strong> and bring it to the customer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍽️ <strong>Payment:</strong> After eating, look at them again to receive money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Rewards:</strong> Earn cash and feedback</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔧 Upgrades &amp; Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of expanding your restaurant, you improve efficiency:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍺 Unlock new products (beer, coffee, schnitzel, toast)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ increase <strong>customer waiting time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍🍳 Hire employees to assist and automate tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Attract more customers and increase income</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you perform, the more customers arrive – and the more chaotic it gets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >German tourists will also visit and confuse things by ordering a “Fleischkäsebrötchen”… 😄</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if a customer becomes too annoying:<br>👉 <strong>Throw food at them!</strong><br>Just be careful – it will make them even more aggressive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you handle the pressure and turn your restaurant into Vienna’s most popular Leberkäse spot?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>King Of Leberkas – Austria Restaurant Simulator</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own <strong>restaurant in Vienna</strong> and start with a true Austrian classic: the <strong>Leberkäse sandwich</strong>. Your restaurant itself won’t grow in size – but the number of customers definitely will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful though: your guests are not patient. They have the classic Viennese attitude – short temper, lots of complaints, and quick insults if you mess up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hectic to master:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👀 <strong>Take orders:</strong> Look at a customer to take their order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍳 <strong>Cook:</strong> Go to the correct machine and press <strong>E</strong> to prepare food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 <strong>Serve:</strong> Pick it up with <strong>E</strong> and bring it to the customer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍽️ <strong>Payment:</strong> After eating, look at them again to receive money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Rewards:</strong> Earn cash and feedback</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔧 Upgrades &amp; Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of expanding your restaurant, you improve efficiency:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍺 Unlock new products (beer, coffee, schnitzel, toast)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ increase <strong>customer waiting time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍🍳 Hire employees to assist and automate tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Attract more customers and increase income</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you perform, the more customers arrive – and the more chaotic it gets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >German tourists will also visit and confuse things by ordering a “Fleischkäsebrötchen”… 😄</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if a customer becomes too annoying:<br>👉 <strong>Throw food at them!</strong><br>Just be careful – it will make them even more aggressive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you handle the pressure and turn your restaurant into Vienna’s most popular Leberkäse spot?</p>", "short_description": "Run your own Leberkäse restaurant in Vienna! Prepare Leberkäse sandwiches, deal with grumpy customers, and grow your place into a thriving restaurant in the heart of the city.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553360/e6a51a215aae1469125093c8bc353c9ca0c07d3d/header.jpg?t=1775721689", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553360/b7a9767fe89253e0e87cf74673500e339cc07014/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775721689", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553360/b7a9767fe89253e0e87cf74673500e339cc07014/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775721689", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 372 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class